From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:23:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: samsung: acpm: Add Tensor G4 match data

Google's zumapro.dtsi specifies initdata-base = <0xa000>. Use that
initialization-data base and a distinct clock child name for G4.
The existing polling transport handles its channel table and PMIC
requests without a new queue implementation. The PMIC client source
is unchanged from the public base.

The private Pixel 9a bring-up used this match to read and enable the
two touch rails through the existing ACPM API. The G4 clock child
intentionally remains unbound: no DVFS clock table, scaling or thermal
support is claimed. PMIC and board support are separate dependencies.

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/devices/google/zumapro/+/8831630eee2ad095b85ed452944e6353940966a5/dts/zumapro.dtsi#562
Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/firmware/samsung/exynos-acpm.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/samsung/exynos-acpm.c b/drivers/firmware/samsung/exynos-acpm.c
index cae59ebe9..45f3a5616 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/samsung/exynos-acpm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/samsung/exynos-acpm.c
@@ -42,6 +42,7 @@
 
 #define ACPM_GS101_INITDATA_BASE	0xa000
 #define ACPM_GS201_INITDATA_BASE	0xa000
+#define ACPM_ZUMAPRO_INITDATA_BASE	0xa000
 
 /* Sanity limit for the channel count read from SRAM. */
 #define ACPM_MAX_CHANS			64
@@ -974,6 +975,11 @@ static const struct acpm_match_data acpm_gs201 = {
 	.acpm_clk_dev_name = "gs201-acpm-clk",
 };
 
+static const struct acpm_match_data acpm_zumapro = {
+	.initdata_base = ACPM_ZUMAPRO_INITDATA_BASE,
+	.acpm_clk_dev_name = "zumapro-acpm-clk",
+};
+
 static const struct of_device_id acpm_match[] = {
 	{
 		.compatible = "google,gs101-acpm-ipc",
@@ -981,6 +987,9 @@ static const struct of_device_id acpm_match[] = {
 	}, {
 		.compatible = "google,gs201-acpm-ipc",
 		.data = &acpm_gs201,
+	}, {
+		.compatible = "google,zumapro-acpm-ipc",
+		.data = &acpm_zumapro,
 	},
 	{},
 };
